7adba20290d8cd152830b9ec9.webm?t=1772784462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676220/extras/06d486f7adba20290d8cd152830b9ec9.mp4?t=1772784462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥<strong>Power-Packed Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archie unlocks a delightful arsenal of tools and weapons, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winged Wonder</strong> – Rocket-powered glider flight</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinecone Launcher</strong> – Explosive long-range pinecone blaster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DustBuster</strong> – Vacuum clears entire screens (but no seed drops!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rocky Hammer</strong> – Shattering ground pounds with stun effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hydro Helm</strong> – Breath and light underwater</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phoenix Feather</strong> – Adds a bonus life bar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tech Mech</strong> – Massive power suit for the finale!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676220/extras/cec13a3c8c87f63ec9f2b403b45d0a19.poster.avif?t=1772784462\" width=562 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676220/extras/cec13a3c8c87f63ec9f2b403b45d0a19.webm?t=1772784462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676220/extras/cec13a3c8c87f63ec9f2b403b45d0a19.mp4?t=1772784462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👹 <strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against over-the-top villains with wild mechanics and story depth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧀 Ray the Rat</strong> – Bomb-throwing cheese goblin of Hill Hopping</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐞 <strong>Big Bug</strong> – Digs, rolls, and drops from above</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪨 <strong>Rocky Ronster</strong> – Fire punches and rising lava puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Whirlpool Wave</strong> – Water vortexes and monster summons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎩 <strong>The Magnificent Marvo</strong> – Magic squirrel with illusions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦅 <strong>Flam</strong> – Quill attacks, divebombs, and stormy skies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Crazy Guy</strong> – Goo-mutated final villain with 3 chaotic phases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has a backstory, a twist, and a kid-style flair that brings Logan’s world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>❓Frequently Asked Questions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is there a demo?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 Yes! A demo is in the works featuring the early levels of <strong>Hill Hopping</strong>, including the Pinecone Launcher and Harvest Pulse System. Wishlist now and be the first to know when it drops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who created the game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Originally imagined by Logan when he was just 6 years old! He sketched out the characters, enemies, and worlds. His dad, a game dev and forever-kid-at-heart, helped bring it to life using <strong>GameMaker Studio 2</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How long is the game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ 6–8 hours for the main story. Expect longer playtimes for 100% completionists collecting <strong>Game Pieces</strong>, unlocking <strong>Logan’s concept art</strong>, and revisiting earlier levels with new tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is the Harvest Pulse System?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ It’s a power-management system that rewards exploration and smart combat. <strong>Golden Seeds</strong> fuel your tools and weapons—each with its own charge meter and tactical use. Manage your energy to fly, fight, or defend at just the right moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is it kid-friendly?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍👩‍👧 Yes! The game is designed with <strong>all-ages storytelling</strong>, gentle humor, and safe themes. But don’t be fooled—beneath the charm is a platformer that’ll challenge players who dig deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can I use a controller?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Absolutely. Full controller support, including <strong>Steam Deck</strong>, keyboard &amp; mouse remapping, and future support for Nintendo Switch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will it run on my setup?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖥️ It’s optimized for 60 FPS and lightweight enough for most modern PCs and laptops. 4K and ultrawide support included.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What platforms is it coming to?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Launching first on <strong>Windows PC</strong> and <strong>macOS</strong>, with <strong>Nintendo Switch</strong> coming post-launch. Linux is being explored based on demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When is it coming out?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 📅 2025! Wishlist it now and follow us on dev logs and social to stay in the loop. 💛</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💌 <strong>6 Years in the Making</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as bedtime drawings and doodles has become a full-fledged adventure. <strong>Pigeon’s Mission</strong> is a love letter to childhood creativity, pixel nostalgia, and the magic of making games <i>together</i>. Whether you’re a kid, a parent, or a platformer fan—this game is for you.</p>",
        "short_description": "Soar into a pixel-rich platformer born from a 6-year-old’s imagination! Join Archie, a brave flightless pigeon, on a heartfelt quest to save his parents. Explore Pepper Pines, unlock quirky gadgets, and power up with the Harvest Pulse System in a whimsical platforming adventure.",
